        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.6-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg> ۱ سال سابقه</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12v4"/><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M17 13h.01"/></svg> ۱۸ تا ۲۵ میلیون تومان</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg> تمام‌وقت</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" asp-page="/Job">مشاهده جزئیات و ارسال رزومه <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg></a>
    </article><article class="card job-card">
      <div class="job-head">
        <div><h3 class="card-title"><a asp-page="/Job">سرپرست خط تولید نانوسنگ</a></h3>
          <div class="card-meta"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21V4h10v17M14 9h6v12M7 8h4M7 12h4M7 16h4M17 13h1M17 17h1"/></svg> تولید</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg> تهران – چهاردانگه</span></div></div>
        <span class="badge badge-soft">تمام‌وقت</span>
      </div>
      <p class="card-text">مدیریت شیفت تولید، کنترل کیفیت خروجی و برنامه‌ریزی تأمین مواد اولیه خط نانوسنگ.…</p>
      <ul class="job-tags">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 3.6-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg> ۴ سال سابقه</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12v4"/><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M17 13h.01"/></svg> ۳۰ تا ۴۰ میلیون تومان</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg> تمام‌وقت</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" asp-page="/Job">مشاهده جزئیات و ارسال رزومه <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg></a>
    </article></div>
    <div class="card hr-card">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6"/></svg>
